sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant VPCE as VPC Endpoint
    participant GWLB as Gateway Load Balancer
    participant Appliance as 3rd Party Appliance
    participant Target as Target

    Client->>VPCE: Send traffic
    VPCE->>GWLB: Forward via GENEVE / UDP 6081
    GWLB->>Appliance: Inspect / process traffic
    Appliance->>GWLB: Return inspected traffic
    GWLB->>Target: Forward to target via GENEVE / UDP 6081
    Target->>GWLB: Response
    GWLB->>VPCE: Return via GENEVE / UDP 6081
    VPCE->>Client: Deliver response
